OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FBright
OL,6,Fspells and scattered showers in the
OL,7,Fevening. It will then be mostly dry
OL,8,Fovernight with clear spells but the
OL,9,Fodd shower will move in from the west.
OL,10,
OL,11,CSaturday:FA lot of dry and bright
OL,12,Fweather across Glasgow and the south.
OL,13,FCloudier across Argyll with a few
OL,14,Fshowers.
OL,15,
OL,16,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:FRather
OL,17,Fcloudy with more scattered showers on
OL,18,FSunday. A dry start to Monday then
OL,19,Frain spreading east. Showers or longer
OL,20,Fspells of rain on Tuesday.
